  "limitations": [
    "RTX 5090 beta.8 binds source 41f89b310b443481db5917a01a2b45e49f85e723. Native v0.8.0-qwen38-3090-beta.4 (tc) binds source 15c3e3959c0a6167f799e9383482ec4e03db9cad, which adds only the native qualification power-check fix and corrected Windows notes to it; serve inputs are identical. Native v0.8.0-qwen38-4090-beta.3 (default) is carried unchanged from v0.18.0 with source 48c8ac4644322f024b5c3bd5b657af5874567251, its published package and qualification; it has no bounded pressure saves and re-cuts with the next engine freeze. Exact current lane evidence is separate from product-route acceptance.",
    "Stock upstream OMP 18.20.0 uses explicit qwen3 tokenizers for opaque aliases, supported effort clamps and disabled automatic update/setup. Explicit omp update remains an operator action; no client binary was executed by the source/download review.",
    "Retained RTX 5090 qwen38-5090-v0.13.0 configuration 751d22dc, 131072 context, BF16 auto KV, DFlash2 K7, C2 and 180-second pending timeout; optional pacing stays off. No fairness or general performance guarantee.",
    "Successor host checkpoints-v019 is isolated from predecessor checkpoints-v018, checkpoints-v017 and checkpoints-v013; retained container mount/profile names do not establish cross-binary checkpoint compatibility. Preserve old stores and replay authoritative OMP transcripts.",
    "Retryable pressure-save refusals (filesystem capacity, I/O outage, stale tag) settle after six retries or 10 seconds with one pressure/abandoned receipt; a refusal from the store's own quota (reason quota) settles at once with no pressure/abandoned receipt. Deferred coordinator residuals are tracked in https://github.com/alphastorm/ninfer/issues/123.",
    "The selected v0.8.0-qwen38-3090-beta.4 package identity, packaged snapshots, current lane/identity/fit/speed observations and published bytes are bound; the carried v0.8.0-qwen38-4090-beta.3 keeps its byte-identical v0.18.0 qualification. No predecessor review approval transfers and production promotion is not authorized.",
    "No predecessor waiver, live-client acceptance, product review approval or public installation result grants this candidate a pass. Fresh five-route acceptance, restoration, composition and exact-subject reviews remain separate gates.",
    "macOS remains manual-SSH preview; Linux client evidence is WSL2-scoped. Image input is RTX 5090 macOS/Windows only. Publication and production promotion remain founder-owned."
